// BT-3981: an evaluated block literal that binds a local, writes a field or
// sends to `self`, in the host/position cells that answer the value.
// Every host/position cell of the grid: BT-3982 lowers an actor evaluated block
// as a producer wherever it sits, so the cells BT-3981 rejected (they answered
// the raw {Value, State} tuple) run too.

Actor subclass: Bt3981EvalblockActor
